# syntax=ghcr.io/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tt-metalium/tools/dockerfile-frontend:1.25
# (docker/dockerfile:1.25, the latest release, re-hosted on our own ghcr.io - was untagged
# `docker/dockerfile:1` (floating); see dockerfile/Dockerfile's syntax line for why)
